DESCRIPTION:Skip entirely if body battery on waking is below 50\; if gate i
 s met\, 25–30 min at 110–128W (Z1 only\, no tempo) — remove the 210
 –244W target entirely this week as it is inappropriate given current fat
 igue state.\n\nReason: Body battery has been critically low (2 on Jul 30\,
  5 on Jul 27) and sleep chronically short\; Z3–Z4 cycling power would ad
 d unabsorbable stress and delay recovery needed for the Half Oceanman swim
  block.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
