SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Replace with a 45–50 min open-water or 
 pool swim at easy aer
DESCRIPTION:Replace with a 45–50 min open-water or pool swim at easy aero
 bic effort (~2:35–2:40/100m) targeting 1\,500–1\,800m — skip the run
  entirely unless sleep averaged 6.5h for Aug 4–8.\n\nReason: With the Ha
 lf Oceanman swim only 55 days away from Aug 9\, substituting a Sunday run 
 with an additional swim session accelerates the critical swim volume build
  without adding musculoskeletal load on a fatigued body.\n\nAI coaching 20
 26-08-01
