SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] running — Cap at 12–13km @ 6:45–7:00/km (85–9
 0 min max)\, HR strictly b
DESCRIPTION:Cap at 12–13km @ 6:45–7:00/km (85–90 min max)\, HR strict
 ly below 145 bpm\; if body battery on waking is below 50\, replace with a 
 60 min pool swim at aerobic pace.\n\nReason: Given the 4-week sleep defici
 t and minimal swim training\, protecting recovery to allow swim volume to 
 increase is higher priority than hitting long-run distance targets 7 weeks
  before the nearest race.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
