SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Add one open-water swim session in the mo
 rning (45–60 min\, 1
DESCRIPTION:Add one open-water swim session in the morning (45–60 min\, 1
 \,500–2\,000m at 2:25–2:30/100m in sea) before the afternoon ride\, re
 ducing the ride to 75–80km to manage total daily load — this is the Ha
 lf Oceanman swim simulation window.\n\nReason: Week 9 is 42 days from the 
 Half Oceanman\; inserting a race-pace open-water swim before the long ride
  builds the specific conditioning and pacing feel needed while Malta's war
 m sea conditions are optimal.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
END:VEVENT
