DESCRIPTION:Replace with full rest or a 15–20 min very easy shakeout jog 
 at 7:00/km with 4×80m strides — no swimming 2 days before a run race\; 
 legs and nervous system must be fresh for race morning.\n\nReason: Swimmin
 g 60 min two days before the Treviso 10K creates upper-body fatigue and gl
 ycogen demand that will compromise race performance on Oct 11.\n\nAI coach
 ing 2026-08-01
