SUMMARY:[AI ADJUSTED] cycling — Replace with complete rest — no cycling
 \, no cross-training\; 
DESCRIPTION:Replace with complete rest — no cycling\, no cross-training\;
  allow full glycogen restoration\, sleep in\, hydrate\, and do pre-race lo
 gistics only.\n\nReason: A 240-minute ride the day before a 10K race would
  catastrophically compromise leg freshness and is a mandatory pre-race con
 flict that must be removed entirely.\n\nAI coaching 2026-08-01
